  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries.</li>\n• <li>Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.</li>\n• <li>Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355dd378378da7aae308/step-0e107200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Finely chop or crush garlic. </li>\n• <li>Thinly capsicum and brown onion (see ingredients).</li>\n• <li>Roughly chop coriander.</li>\n• <li>Drain and rinse black beans.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355dd378378da7aae308/step-a4ca9d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook capsicum, black beans and onion until tender, 3-4 mins. Add garlic, tomato paste and Mexican fiesta spice blend (SPICY! Use less if you’re sensitive to heat) and cook, tossing until fragrant, 1-2 mins.</li>\n• <li>Stir in the water, brown sugar, butter and salt. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355dd378378da7aae308/step-41811920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Divide fries between plates.</li>\n• <li>Top with Mexican Fiesta black beans and sour cream.</li>\n• <li>Sprinkle with coriander to serve.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b7355dd378378da7aae308/step-540c9330.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
